#Components Required – Obstacle Avoiding Car

#Hardware Components

#Sr. No.	Component Name	Quantity
1	Arduino UNO R3	1
2	L298N Motor Driver Module	1
3	HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor	1
4	SG90 Servo Motor	1
5	12V DC Geared Motors	4
6	Robot Car Chassis	1
7	3.7V Li-ion Battery Cells	2
8	18650 Battery Holder	1
10	Jumper Wires	1 Set
11	Robot Wheels	4

#Component Functions

* Arduino UNO: Controls the complete robot.
* L298N: Controls the speed and direction of DC motors.
* HC-SR04: Detects obstacles using ultrasonic waves.
* SG90 Servo: Rotates the ultrasonic sensor left and right.
* DC Motors: Move the robot car.
* Battery: Supplies electrical power to the system.

Project Specifications

* Project Name: Obstacle Avoiding Car
* Controller: Arduino UNO
* Motor Driver: L298N
* Obstacle Detection: HC-SR04
* Sensor Rotation: SG90 Servo Motor
* Number of Motors: 4
